# Pinned picoruby-ti (editor type inference engine) fork revision.
# Same scheme as components/fmrb_spinel_rt/SPINEL_PIN:
# - `rake ti:setup` clones this exact commit into vendor/picoruby-ti
#   (gitignored), so a plain `git clone` of fmruby-core is enough to build
#   the engine -- no external checkout required.
# - The clone is NOT recursive on purpose: picoruby-ti carries its own
#   lib/prism submodule, but the firmware parses with the prism bundled in
#   mruby-compiler (both are prism 1.9.0).
# - fmrb-dev is the integration branch of the fork (upstream-candidate work
#   lives on fmrb-inheritance). To update: push the fork, bump the commit
#   here, re-run `rake ti:setup`.
